        "id": 5227,
        "name": "Red Legacy",
        "username": "Red_Legacy",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/82dd89/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-09-29T02:41:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was just curious if any of the designers could shed some light on the fictional comic series behind the game? The thing that I’ve noticed is that a lot of the comics that are referred to on flavor text and the bios show that the fictional comic universe is very well established, with annuals suggesting the comics have been around for 15 years+, and issue numbers over 500.</p>\n<p>How much work did you guys put into fleshing out the actual comics, or were the issue numbering just randomly picked? Is there a super secret master list of the the fictional comic ttiles in your universe, complete with a breakdown of all the story lines?</p>\n<p>I think any behind the scenes insight on this would be really interesting.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:49.322Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
