      {
        "id": 22979,
        "name": "Christopher",
        "username": "Christopher",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-09-29T13:57:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This was all part of the original vision for the game: that the lore and flavor text would hint at a massive world pulled from the pages of long-running comic books.  The bulk of it came from a weekend of Adam and I sitting down and mapping out the vast majority of the timeline, and whenever we create new things (which is what takes up the bulk of our time these days) we make sure they fit well in the established continuum.</p>\n<p>We’ve also planned out what is “supposed” to happen going forward, in that the plot lines for all the major characters and many of the secondary characters are already set.  A lot of that sort of stuff is hinted at through the flavor text, art, and the bios on the website.</p>\n<p>Thanks for taking an interest in what is one of my favorite parts of this whole thing!</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:57:00.642Z",
